# The GloVe table: 400k words x 50 floats, 163MB of ASCII. Public, immutable,
# and reproducible byte-for-byte from the pinned URL and SHA-256 in
# scripts/fetch.rb, so versioning it would buy no reproducibility and cost
# every clone 163MB of git objects forever. GitHub would refuse the push
# anyway; the per-file limit is 100MB.
#
# vectors-slice.txt is the committed answer to "can I re-run this without the
# download": it carries only the words words.yml names, and the direction test
# runs off it whole.
data/
